 "slug": "twins",
 "lines": [
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "I bet $100 you didn't know there are some countries that look completely different, but are almost exactly the same size!",
   "chunks": [
    "I BET *$100*",
    "YOU DIDN'T KNOW|THERE ARE SOME COUNTRIES",
    "THAT LOOK|*COMPLETELY DIFFERENT,*",
    "BUT ARE ALMOST|EXACTLY THE *SAME SIZE!*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Let's start with number five: nepal and bangladesh.",
   "chunks": [
    "LET'S START WITH|*NUMBER FIVE:*",
    "*NEPAL* AND *BANGLADESH.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "They are only 22 km apart, but one touches the sky with mount everest, while the other touches the ocean with its rivers!",
   "chunks": [
    "THEY ARE ONLY|*22 KM* APART,",
    "BUT ONE TOUCHES|THE *SKY*",
    "WITH *MOUNT EVEREST,*",
    "WHILE THE OTHER|TOUCHES THE *OCEAN*",
    "WITH ITS *RIVERS!*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Number four is guinea and the united kingdom.",
   "chunks": [
    "*NUMBER FOUR* IS",
    "*GUINEA* AND THE|*UNITED KINGDOM.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "You won't believe it. once the biggest empire in the world, it now has an area as small as guinea.",
   "chunks": [
    "YOU WON'T|BELIEVE IT.",
    "ONCE THE *BIGGEST*|*EMPIRE* IN THE WORLD,",
    "IT NOW HAS AN AREA",
    "AS SMALL AS *GUINEA.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So sad.",
   "chunks": [
    "*SO SAD.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "uk"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Number three is chile and zambia.",
   "chunks": [
    "*NUMBER THREE* IS",
    "*CHILE* AND *ZAMBIA.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "If you pull zambia like chewing gum, then you would get another chile of the same size.",
   "chunks": [
    "IF YOU PULL *ZAMBIA*",
    "LIKE *CHEWING GUM,*",
    "THEN YOU WOULD GET|ANOTHER *CHILE*",
    "OF THE *SAME SIZE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Number two is italy and the philippines.",
   "chunks": [
    "*NUMBER TWO* IS",
    "*ITALY* AND THE|*PHILIPPINES.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "One looks like a boot, while the other looks like a sitting man.",
   "chunks": [
    "ONE LOOKS|LIKE A *BOOT,*",
    "WHILE THE OTHER LOOKS|LIKE A *SITTING MAN.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "But put them together, and they form a complete human body.",
   "chunks": [
    "BUT PUT THEM|*TOGETHER,*",
    "AND THEY FORM A|*COMPLETE HUMAN BODY.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And number one... is malaysia and vietnam!",
   "chunks": [
    "AND *NUMBER ONE...*",
    "IS *MALAYSIA*|AND *VIETNAM!*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Both are in southeast asia, have long coastlines, and are almost the same size.",
   "chunks": [
    "BOTH ARE IN|*SOUTHEAST ASIA,*",
    "HAVE LONG *COASTLINES,*",
    "AND ARE ALMOST|THE *SAME SIZE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "I think they were made for each other.",
   "chunks": [
    "I THINK THEY WERE|*MADE FOR EACH OTHER.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Want to go double or nothing? because...",
   "chunks": [
    "WANT TO GO|*DOUBLE OR NOTHING?*",
    "*BECAUSE...*"
   ]
  }
 ],
